        "content": "Click any task card, then drag-drop or click to upload your Excel file (.xlsx, .xls, .csv, .ods supported)."
      },
      "q2": {
        "title": "Is my data safe?",
        "content": "Absolutely! All file processing happens locally in your browser. We cannot access any of your data. The network monitor at the bottom shows if any data is transmitted externally."
      },
      "q3": {
        "title": "How to save processed files?",
        "content": "After processing, click the 'Export' button and the file will download directly to your device."
      },
      "q4": {
        "title": "Are large files supported?",
        "content": "Yes! Desktop supports files up to 100MB, mobile is limited to 50MB."
      }
